g\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\t\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:14px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\u0022\u003EIt\u0026#39;s the perfect study break \u0026mdash; a guilt-free reason to close the laptop and \u0026ldquo;Read For Good\u0026rdquo;\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\t\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:14px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\u0022\u003ENo book on you? We\u0026#39;ve got you covered \u0026mdash; \u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#8b4513;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESMU Libraries will have books on-site\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/span\u003E you can just pick up and start reading\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\t\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:14px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\u0022\u003EInto something already? Bring it along \u0026mdash; \u003Cspan style=\u0022color:#8b4513;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eyour own book, magazine, article, eBook, or audiobook (headphones/earphones if you\u0026#39;re going audio)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\t\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:14px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\u0022\u003EChill vibes, good company \u0026mdash; read alongside fellow students, faculty and staff in a quiet, no-pressure space\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\n\u003Cp style=\u0022margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size:14px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\u0022\u003EPhotos of participants and the books they\u0026#39;re reading will be taken during the session, so bring your best reading-nook energy\u0026nbsp;\ud83d\udcd6\ud83d\udd0b\ud83d\udca1\u003C/span\u003E\u